<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai and Cambodian militaries met for informal border talks to strengthen truce implementation while Cambodia rejected Thai claims over border temples. Thailand promoted cross-border tourism with road-trip packages, a travel guidebook and a 15‑day visa-free scheme, and introduced digital border passes at Mae Sai. Thai police seized over 449,000 illegal cosmetics in Bangkok and targeted a cross-border money-laundering network, freezing assets worth more than 26 billion baht and aiming to seize over US$1 billion from accused scammers. The EU pledged $3.3 million for de-mining along the border, and a Chinese woman reported being abducted after an online dating trick in Thailand. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQWEtFYnFjRklSS2tsNi1Mb0dtUklqR2FtMWo3QUVRUkVXc3F1YWJEUVpQSVRTRlJhTFhtd2JzZ1NyTnhCUWYxQ1NNTjk1WHM1R0VrX3RzSktYSGF0Y083clV6c09JZHQ2VXB0QU1Ic25Ca3BrTW1BQmMyS0VIamw0WW11RmM4Rm5rN1NsVURUOWpqQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOWThRWWcwbTlaeTdBYTJXaEZJdkJMZGJKUm4tT2t0LXM3aEhFbkMtYm9kRmlHYVpsWWpWWFZkYkNldzVPYXlqM0F2OVZaV2ltQ3dVTnNiSVZZTXYwWV95SFFqT0sxOFVuM21MLTJJNzlEZE1RSWw0OGIybkYzU29RbHdWLUdGSGJ2XzJvWUtwQWZrVWpf?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPeWZHN2ZBVTRtci1IWEI3QlFEWVdmUEFfdjZxN01Ra0ZULTBEZ3JTdFFkdm1hWDZiaHRrSEE5bm1iMFc5SjIzbUl6bVJZQW9zQlVtX2RmUi1Sa3hfLXAzTl9CckN3STgzTFZGckhXYXZKUDBCeUZ2RnF0Y1pDV284ZWd5QTh1Nnk0YmdpVlhERXdwcmZYaEhhZ2Vnbjh5Nk92eEJaY3NR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPUm16ektzVmIwM2lsSEdWX2Z2eEp2VUdDVTAwOU4zOWg3THZwa0pnZDFUWEdUY3ZibVhWS01XUUxmdU1qRzhJU0pHai1KTzR4T3A1RE